{"text":"So, with the time I have remaining, which is brief, I just want to remind you that my job wasn't to just provide you a laundry list of things you're familiar with, I wanted to give you a snapshot of the current economic environment, recognising that this is part of a broader trend, and I'd like to leave you with just one or two couple of thoughts. So moving forward, the expectation is not just for a recession, as we've heard here in the UK, but globally, if you look at the IMF and World Bank trackers, the sense is that we're in for not just one year, but certainly multiple years of slow and slowing economic growth. The advent of deglobalisation, that is the diminution or breakdown of trade, of capital flows, of immigration, so movement of people, but also multilateralism and this sort of unified view around how the global economy works, all of those are under challenge and in fact...","words":[{"text":"So","start":0.0,"end":0.88,"punct":","},{"text":"with","start":1.24,"end":1.74},{"text":"the","start":1.74,"end":1.88},{"text":"time","start":1.88,"end":2.08},{"text":"I","start":2.08,"end":2.24},{"text":"have","start":2.24,"end":2.48},{"text":"remaining","start":2.48,"end":2.98,"punct":","},{"text":"which","start":3.2,"end":3.24},{"text":"is","start":3.24,"end":3.44},{"text":"brief","start":3.44,"end":3.7,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":4.52,"end":4.74},{"text":"just","start":4.74,"end":5.1},{"text":"want","start":5.1,"end":5.38},{"text":"to","start":5.38,"end":5.92},{"text":"remind","start":5.92,"end":6.68},{"text":"you","start":6.68,"end":7.1},{"text":"that","start":7.1,"end":7.5},{"text":"my","start":7.5,"end":7.98},{"text":"job","start":7.98,"end":8.2},{"text":"wasn't","start":8.2,"end":8.42},{"text":"to","start":8.42,"end":8.6},{"text":"just","start":8.6,"end":8.7},{"text":"provide","start":8.7,"end":9.04},{"text":"you","start":9.04,"end":9.24},{"text":"a","start":9.24,"end":9.38},{"text":"laundry","start":9.38,"end":9.64},{"text":"list","start":9.64,"